imal production systems.", "Students will apply basic knowledge of animal nutrition, genetics, reproduction, and physiology to domestic animal species.", "Students will practice proper handling of livestock, particularly sheep and horses.", "Students will use the Cornell library resources to research and critique various perspectives of issues related to sustainable domestic animal production systems using scientific journal articles.", "Students will produce a researched outline in order to appreciate the multiple perspectives of a given agricultural issue of interest in sustainable agriculture.", "Students will exchange scientific ideas with classmates during an in-class debate."], "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "AG", "catalogName": null, "catalogNextOffered": null, "lastTermsOffered": "2026SU, 2026WI, 2025SU, 2025WI", "catalogCredits": null, "catalogGradeOption": null, "catalogLocation": null, "catalogCrosslisted": null, "catalogCrosslistings": null, "catalogComeets": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": []}, {"strm": 2944, "crseId": 375706, "crseOfferNbr": 1, "subject": "ANSC", "catalogNbr": "1690", "titleShort": "Biology of Animal Adaptations", "titleLong": "Biology & Evolution of Extreme Animal Adaptations", "crseAttrs": [{"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "BSC-AG", "descr": "AG-Biological Sciences", "descrformal": "AG-Biological Sciences", "attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "attrDescrShort": "DistReq"}, {"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "BIO-AG", "descr": "AG-Intr Life Sci/Bio: Bio", "descrformal": "AG-Intr Life Sci/Biology Requirement: Biology", "attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "attrDescrShort": "DistReq"}], "crseAttrValueGroups": [{"attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "crseAttrValues": "(BIO-AG, BSC-AG)"}], "enrollGroups": [{"classSections": [{"ssrComponent": "LEC", "ssrComponentLong": "Lecture", "section": "001", "classNbr": 1115, "meetings": [{"classMtgNbr": 1, "timeStart": "", "timeEnd": "", "startDt": "01/04/2027", "endDt": "01/22/2